22884      data survey; call streaminit(722); do stratum=1 to 2; do cluster=1 to 4; do id=1 to 12; age=20+mod(id*7+cluster,45); time=1+rand('exponential')*10;
22884    ! status=(mod(id,4) ne 0); weight=2+stratum+cluster/10; output; end; end; end; run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SURVEY has 96 observations and 7 variables.

22885      proc surveyphreg data=survey; strata stratum; cluster cluster; weight weight; model time*status(0)=age; run;


